          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Polar Bear, Kangaroo and Giraffe are on vacation! This time they’re discovering the joys of the seaside.  Kangaroo is taking Polar Bear and Giraffe to one of her favourite places - the beach! Join them as they take a dip in the sea, have a go at surfing, and even learn to crab walk!   This Yoto Original audio card has been specially designed to encourage daily movement and exercise in the home or outside. So what are you waiting for? Let’s move!\n\nDiscover: 2 tracks.  \nAvailable until 30th June.  \nFull Card: 8 tracks.  \nFor ages 4-7.",
